            <ArticleTitle>Ultrasonic findings in silicone-augmented breasts.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>455-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The sonographic and clinical findings in four patients with silicone-augmented breasts are presented. The ultrasonographic differences between breasts with silicone injections and breasts with silicone prosthesis are emphasized. Breast sonography may play a role in evaluation of silicone-augmented breasts. Awareness of this diagnostic procedure may help in evaluating these patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
